}

settings {
  encodeUrl: true
  timeout: 0
}

docs {
  # Submit TACOTS Recommendation
  
  Submits a community recommendation for a student to be considered for the TACOTS scholarship programme. Accepts a multipart form containing student bio-data, school records, family/guardian details, household socioeconomic information, recommender details, and required file uploads (passport photo and last school result).
  
  On success, the recommendation record is saved to the database. The endpoint returns the newly created TACOTS recommendation object with a `201 Created` status.
  
  ## Authorization
  No authentication is required for this endpoint (public form submission).
  
  ## Request Body (`multipart/form-data`)
  
  ### Personal Details
  
  | Field           | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                   |
  |-----------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | firstName       | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                 |
  | middleName      | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                  |
  | surname         | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                 |
  | gender          | string | Yes      | One of: `MALE`, `FEMALE`                                                                                       |
  | age             | number | Yes      | Integer, minimum `6`                                                                                           |
  | dob             | date   | Yes      | ISO date string — `YYYY-MM-DD` format                                                                          |
  | religion        | string | Yes      | One of: `CHRISTIAN / CATHOLIC`, `CHRISTIAN / ANGLICAN`, `CHRISTIAN / OTHER`, `MUSLIM`, `OTHER RELIGIONS`, `NO RELIGION` |
  | catholicSacraments | array | No    | Array of: `BAPTISM`, `FIRST HOLY COMMUNION`, `CONFIRMATION`, `NONE YET` (optional)                            |
  | parishAttended  | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                  |
  | diocese         | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                                  |
  | primaryLanguage | string | Yes      | One of: `ENGLISH`, `IGBO`, `HAUSA`, `YORUBA`, `PIDGIN ENGLISH`, `OTHER`                                       |
  | phoneNumber     | string | No       | Optional phone number                                                                                          |
  | nationality     | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                 |
  | stateOfOrigin   | string | Yes      | Valid Nigerian state (e.g. `ABIA`, `LAGOS`, `FCT`)                                                             |
  | lga             | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                 |
  | homeAddress     | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                 |
  
  ### Academic Records
  
  | Field                  | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                              |
  |------------------------|--------|----------|---------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | schoolName             | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                            |
  | schoolTown             | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                                            |
  | schoolState            | string | Yes      | Valid Nigerian state                                                                                                      |
  | lastYearAttended       | number | Yes      | Integer — e.g. `2024`                                                                                                     |
  | lastClass              | string | Yes      | One of: `PRIMARY 3`, `PRIMARY 4`, `PRIMARY 5`, `PRIMARY 6`, `JSS1`, `JSS2`, `JSS3`, `SS1`, `SS2`, `SS3`                 |
  | classPositionLastTerm  | string | Yes      | Non-empty text (e.g. `3`, `5th`)                                                                                          |
  | lastTermAverage        | number | No       | Optional numeric score                                                                                                    |
  
  ### Parent Information
  
  | Field             | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values |
  |-------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------|
  | fathersName       | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  | fathersOccupation | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  | fathersPhone      | string | Yes      | Non-empty phone number       |
  | mothersName       | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  | mothersOccupation | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  | mothersPhone      | string | Yes      | Non-empty phone number       |
  | parentsAddress    | string | Yes      | Non-empty text               |
  
  ### Guardian Information (Optional)
  
  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                         |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | guardianName         | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                        |
  | guardianPhone        | string | No       | Optional phone number                                                                                |
  | guardianRelationship | string | No       | One of: `GRANDPARENT`, `AUNT/UNCLE`, `SIBLING`, `RELATION`, `COMMUNITY GUARDIAN`, `OTHER` (optional) |
  | guardianOccupation   | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                        |
  | guardianAddress      | string | No       | Optional text                                                                                        |
  
  ### Household & Socioeconomic Information
  
  | Field                  | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                                                                                               |
  |------------------------|--------|----------|----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | householdSize          | number | Yes      | Integer, minimum `2`                                                                                                                                                       |
  | numSiblings            | number | Yes      | Integer, minimum `0`                                                                                                                                                       |
  | familyPosition         | string | Yes      | One of: `1ST`, `2ND`, `3RD`, `4TH`, `5TH`, `6TH`, `7TH`, `8TH`, `9TH`, `10TH`, `OTHER`                                                                                  |
  | specialCircumstances   | string | Yes      | One of: `ORPHAN`, `SINGLE-PARENT`, `LOW FAMILY INCOME`, `NONE`, `OTHER`                                                                                                   |
  | annualHouseholdIncome  | string | Yes      | One of: `NO STABLE INCOME`, `< ₦100,000`, `₦100,000-₦300,000`, `₦300,001-₦600,000`, `₦600,001-₦1,000,000`, `ABOVE ₦1,000,000`                                           |
  | incomeSources          | array  | Yes      | Array of: `FARMING`, `TRADING / SMALL BUSINESS`, `SALARY / FORMAL EMPLOYMENT`, `ARTISAN / SKILLED LABOUR`, `DAILY WAGE WORK`, `SUPPORT FROM RELATIVE`, `GOVERNMENT SUPPORT`, `NO REGULAR INCOME`, `OTHER` |
  | numIncomeEarners       | string | Yes      | One of: `NONE`, `1`, `2`, `3`, `MORE THAN 3`                                                                                                                              |
  | avgMonthlyIncome       | number | No       | Optional numeric value                                                                                                                                                     |
  | livesWith              | string | Yes      | One of: `BOTH PARENTS`, `MOTHER ONLY`, `FATHER ONLY`, `GRANDPARENT`, `OTHER RELATIVE`, `GUARDIAN`, `ALONE`                                                                |
  | residenceType          | string | Yes      | One of: `FAMILY HOUSE`, `RENTED APARTMENT`, `SHARED ACCOMMODATION`, `TEMPORARY SHELTER`, `OTHER`                                                                          |
  | hasElectricity         | string | Yes      | One of: `YES`, `NO`, `SOMETIMES`                                                                                                                                           |
  
  ### Recommender Details
  
  | Field                | Type   | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values                                                                        |
  |----------------------|--------|----------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | recommenderFirstName | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                      |
  | recommenderLastName  | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                      |
  | recommenderPhone     | string | Yes      | Non-empty phone number                                                                              |
  | recommenderAddress   | string | Yes      | Non-empty text                                                                                      |
  | childBackgroundNotes | string | Yes      | Non-empty description of the child's background                                                     |
  | supportTypesNeeded   | array  | Yes      | Array of: `TUITION (SCHOOL FEES)`, `SCHOOL RESOURCES`, `TRANSPORTATION`, `OTHER`                   |
  | otherImportantInfo   | string | No       | Optional free text                                                                                  |
  
  ### Student Assessment & Declaration
  
  | Field                | Type    | Required | Constraints / Allowed Values        |
  |----------------------|---------|----------|-------------------------------------|
  | disciplineRating     | number  | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`             |
  | responsibilityRating | number  | Yes      | Integer from `1` to `5`             |
  | careerGoal           | string  | Yes      | Non-empty text                      |
  | studentStatement     | string  | No       | Optional free text                  |
  | declarationConfirmed | boolean | Yes      | Must be `true`. Defaults to `false` |
  
  ## File Uploads
  
  | Field         | MIME Types Accepted         | Required   | Notes                                                                  |
  |---------------|-----------------------------|------------|------------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | passportPhoto | `image/*` (JPEG, PNG, etc.) | **Yes**    | Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/TACOTS-ASSETS/PASSPORTS` on Cloudinary |
  | lastResult    | PDF, image                  | **Yes**    | Student's last school result. Uploaded to `/Cedarrise Initiative/TACOTS-ASSETS/RESULTS` on Cloudinary |
  
  ## Response
  
  **`201 Created`** — Returns the newly created TACOTS recommendation record.
  
  ## Errors
  
  | Status                      | Description                                                           |
  |-----------------------------|-----------------------------------------------------------------------|
  | `400 Bad Request`           | Validation failed — missing required fields or invalid enum values.   |
  | `400 Bad Request`           | No files were attached to the request.                                |
  | `500 Internal Server Error` | Cloudinary upload failed for `passportPhoto` or `lastResult`.         |
}
